            "review_text": "Brian L\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam268 contributions\n0\nSummer breeze by the river\nJul 2017 • Friends\nSitting at the side of the huge Saigon River in Binh Quoi with the fresh breeze blowing just after sun down is really a nice thing to enjoy. Song Trang restaurant is perfectly placed for this experience with friends & family and the really good local food just makes it all so much more enjoyable.\nThis has to go on everybody's \"bucket list' when visiting Vietnam\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 14, 2017",
